[00:21.14]1. We praise you, Jehovah, deep from our hearts,
[00:28.20]For in your Word we find
[00:34.38]Your power supreme, your wisdom so great,
[00:41.30]And yet you are loving and kind.
[00:48.14]2. Your Son still invites those bruised by the world
[00:54.92]To leave their cares behind.
[01:02.58]How kindly his yoke, how tender his heart,
[01:09.30]He’s always refreshing and kind.
[01:43.68]3. We see in our God and Jesus our Lord,
[01:50.50]The persons we should be.
[01:57.26]The power of kindness we can possess.
[02:03.64]With kindness, how strong we can be!
